# graft's local graph cache — regenerable, not committed (run `graft build`).
/graft/

# Files graft 0.29.0 `graft init` writes into every fresh worktree (docs/queue.md Carried 47; operator ruling 2026-11-15).
# Exactly the paths it creates that this repo does not track, anchored at the root. Not `.agents/` (it holds tracked skills);
# graft's edits to tracked files (AGENTS.md, .claude/, .cursor/) cannot be ignored and are not listed.
/.adal/
/.gemini/
/.grok/
/.kiro/
/.windsurf/
/.github/copilot-instructions.md

__pycache__/
.ruff_cache/
.zcode/

# SkillOpt-Sleep dirs: kept until the operator removes the harvested dirs (E10 report G).
/.skillopt-sleep/
/.skillopt-sleep-handoff/

# Paseo's skill sync marker (it writes one beside each bundled skill it manages; see docs/skill-everywhere.md 3a).
skills/*/.paseo-managed-files.json

# Identity guard test repositories left by an interrupted run.
/.identity-test-*/
.aider*

# Claude Code agent worktrees (Agent tool isolation: worktree; claude --worktree).
.claude/worktrees/

# Paseo baton plugin handoff files.
.paseo/
